<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63373" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίν-εος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιν-οῦς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆ</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίνον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of flax,
				linen</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιθών, θώρηξ</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.195
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.47
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					389b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαῖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					616a6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					1036.14
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφέλαι</span>
			(i. e. nets) <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.</u>
				3.1.37
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλα λ.</span> cables <i>of
				flax</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.36
			</span></i>: also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λινᾶ, τά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				206
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				19
			</span></i>: Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λινέη, ἡ</span>,
				<i>tape-measure</i> used in building, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.3073.128
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Lebadea</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Bito
				63.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιναία</span>
			); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιναῖος</span>.</div>
